trong>非套房&nbsp;非套房&nbsp;非套房</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 153, 0);\"><strong>屋內含以下家俱<br>電視<br>雙層大冰箱<br>洗脫烘滾筒洗衣機<br>3*5呎掀床<br>獨立陽台&nbsp;獨立對外窗<br>500m網路<br>無線第四台<br>24小時影像監控<br></strong></span><strong><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 204);\"><strong>電費一度5元<br><br>禁煙、禁寵、禁炊、禁不良習慣<br><br>房東自租免帶看費&nbsp;&nbsp;仲介勿擾<br><br>一卡皮箱就可入住<br></strong></span><strong><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 51, 204);\"><strong>承租者需有正當職業&nbsp;&nbsp;需出示証件或其他工作相關証明&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 51, 204);\"><strong>租金&nbsp;&nbsp;一租二押&nbsp;&nbsp;都以匯款方式匯繳租&nbsp;固定日期繳租</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 51, 204);\"><strong>一年一約&nbsp;&nbsp;每年固定換新租約</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>禁止非法或轉租他人使用<br><br>為保障其他房客及鄰居居住品質及安全嚴禁吸煙、吸毒、聚賭、開PA、</strong></span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>嚴重者會提起訴訟<br><br>若發現非法行為會立即通知轄區員警&nbsp;不會寬容<br><br>押金一拼不退還、上述條件同意會註明在合約內&nbsp;<br><br>以上條件無法配合請跳過本頁&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><br></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 0); background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>若有其他問題請直接來電或訊息留言&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區永安北路一段27巷", "lat": "25.0754642", "lng": "121.4773162", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "五年千歲[新巴士]站", "distance": 163, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約163公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "永福街124號[新巴士]站", "distance": 210, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約210公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "和成新村[新巴士]站", "distance": 216, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約216公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "橡木桶洋酒蘆洲店", "distance": 714, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約714公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "米香早點", "distance": 75, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約75公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "educatio